与推测 | wiki/concepts/observation-vs-inference.md | 无 | not-started |\\n| C02 多属性比较 | wiki/concepts/attribute-comparison.md | C01 | not-started |\\n| C03 分类与反例 | wiki/concepts/classification-counterexample.md | C02 | not-started |\\n| C04 规律识别与检验 | wiki/concepts/pattern-rule.md | C02 | not-started |\\n| C05 系统枚举 | wiki/concepts/systematic-enumeration.md | C03, C04 | not-started |\\n| C06 条件推理及逆推陷阱 | wiki/concepts/conditional-reasoning.md | C01, C05 | not-started |\\n| C07 证据可靠性与替代解释 | wiki/concepts/evidence-and-alternatives.md | C01, C06 | not-started |\\n| C08 结构化论证与倾听 | wiki/concepts/structured-argument.md | C07 | not-started |\\n| C09 复杂问题与约束分解 | wiki/concepts/constraint-decomposition.md | C05, C06 | not-started |\\n| C10 多视角与方案权衡 | wiki/concepts/perspectives-tradeoffs.md | C08, C09 | not-started |\\n| C11 创造性发散 | wiki/concepts/divergent-ideas.md | 无 | not-started |\\n| C12 原型测试与迭代 | wiki/concepts/prototype-testing.md | C09, C11 | not-started |\\n| C13 跨情境策略选择 | wiki/concepts/strategy-transfer.md | C05, C07, C09 | not-started |\\n| C14 计划、监控与反思 | wiki/concepts/plan-monitor-reflect.md | 无 | not-started |\\n\\nC11、C14 的穿插关系不等同硬性先修；只列未来建议，未授权教学。\\n\\n路线版本：1；当前 C01，诊断待答，H0；尚无回答或学习表现证据。\\n\\n首题原答已保存；分类正确，理由未知，不授予掌握。下一步保持 C01 并追问依据。\\n\\n路线版本：2；同一 C01 情境追问依据，H0，等待回答。\\n\",\n  \"turns\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"question\",\n      \"question_id\": \"synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-001\",\n      \"text\": \"你看到窗台上有一个花盆，盆旁有一小摊水；有人说“刚才一定有人给花浇水了”。你认为这句话是观察事实还是推测，请说说判断依据？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"answer\",\n      \"question_id\": \"synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-001\",\n      \"text\": \"推测。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"question\",\n      \"question_id\": \"synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-002\",\n      \"text\": \"你是根据什么，把“刚才一定有人给花浇水了”判断为推测的？\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 -B - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess\n\ndef run(*args,payload=None):\n r=subprocess.run(['python3','-B','scripts/sigma_session_store.py',*args],input=json.dumps(payload,ensure_ascii=False) if payload else None,capture_output=True,text=True,check=True);return json.loads(r.stdout)\ns=run('read','--learner','synthetic-live')\nassert s['revision']==5\npending={}\nfor t in s['turns']:\n if t['type']=='question':\n  assert t['question_id'] not in pending\n  pending[t['question_id']]=t\n elif t['type']=='answer':\n  assert t['question_id'] in pending\n  del pending[t['question_id']]\nassert list(pending)==['synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-002']\ns['turns'].append({'type':'answer','question_id':'synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-002','text':'可能有人浇了，也可能是杯子里的水洒了，我没有看到水怎么来的。'})\ns['state']['phase']='answer_received';s['state'].pop('pending_question_id',None)\nr=run('commit','--learner','synthetic-live','--expected-revision','5',payload={k:s[k] for k in ('state','session','turns')})\nprint('原答保存成功，revision='+str(r['revision']))\nPY\ncat wiki/concepts/observation-vs-inference.md pilot-c01-c02/wiki/concepts/C01.md\npython3 -B scripts/sigma_plan_store.py status --learner synthetic-live\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 -B - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess\n\ndef run(*args,payload=None):\n r=subprocess.run(['python3','-B','scripts/sigma_session_store.py',*args],input=json.dumps(payload,ensure_ascii=False) if payload else None,capture_output=True,text=True,check=True);return json.loads(r.stdout)\ns=run('read','--learner','synthetic-live')\nassert s['revision']==5\npending={}\nfor t in s['turns']:\n if t['type']=='question':\n  assert t['question_id'] not in pending\n  pending[t['question_id']]=t\n elif t['type']=='answer':\n  assert t['question_id'] in pending\n  del pending[t['question_id']]\nassert list(pending)==['synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-002']\ns['turns'].append({'type':'answer','question_id':'synthetic-live-c01-dynamic-002','text':'可能有人浇了，也可能是杯子里的水洒了，我没有看到水怎么来的。'})\ns['state']['phase']='answer_received';s['state'].pop('pending_question_id',None)\nr=run('commit','--learner','synthetic-live','--expected-revision','5',payload={k:s[k] for k in ('state','session','turns')})\nprint('原答保存成功，revision='+str(r['revision']))\nPY\ncat wiki/concepts/observation-vs-inference.md pilot-c01-c02/wiki/concepts/C01.md\npython3 -B scripts/sigma_plan_store.py status --learner synthetic-live\"","aggregated_output":"原答保存成功，revision=6\n# C01 观察事实与推测\n\n- **知识点编号**：C01\n- **主要周次**：W01\n- **训练能力**：观察分析；批判性思考\n- **先修**：无\n- **概念定义（项目原创表述）**：观察事实是可以直接从材料中核查的描述；推测是对事实可能原因/含义的解释。\n\n<!-- roadmap-metadata\n{\n  \"abilities\": [\n    \"观察分析\",\n    \"批判性思考\"\n  ],\n  \"hard_prerequisites\": [],\n  \"interleavable\": []\n}\n-->\n\n## 教学动作\n列举三条可见线索→标注“事实/猜测”→说出缺少的证据。\n\n## 自编例子\n桌面有一本合着的书，并不能证明有人刚读完。\n\n## 常见错误\n把人物意图、过去事件和未来预测写成已发生的事实。\n\n## 掌握与迁移\n- **掌握判据**：面对两个新场景能各说出3条事实+1条推测，并提出一条核实方法。\n- **新情境**：看教室照片、家中鞋柜、实验记录，辨别观察和解释。\n\n## 三阶启发式引导\n1. 请先说你已经知道什么，不急着选答案。\n2. 哪条线索或哪一个限制能帮助你检查？\n3. 试着画一个表、示范一个局部步骤，再由你完成余下部分。\n\n## 对应题目\n- `ST-C01-01`\n- `ST-C01-02`\n\n## 来源与知识关系\n- **来源索引**：R04, R06（详见 `../../references/sources.md`）\n- **相关先修**：无\n- **版权**：本页表述和例子为本项目独立编写；不含原教材文本。\n---\ntitle: C01 观察事实与推测\ntype: concept\ntags: [curriculum, observation, beginner]\nsources: [project-research]\nlast_updated: 2026-11-04\n---\n# C01 观察事实与推测\n\n## Core Thesis\n可直接核查的描述和对原因、经历、意图的猜测不同。\n\n## Problem Definition\n先说题目明确呈现的信息，再区分未直接给出的解释。\n\n## Terminology\n事实：可直接核查的描述；推测：可能的解释，需额外证据。\n\n## Mental Model\n看到/题设 → 事实；由线索猜原因 → 推测；再想如何核实。\n\n## Minimal Implementation\n说出事实、标出猜测、描述如何核实；不要求揣测人物心理。\n\n## System Position\n- Inherits from: 无。\n- Prepares for: [[concepts/C02]]。\n- Sources: [[sources/project-research]]。\n\n## Common Errors (Behavioral)\n把物品状态误当成已知发生过程。\n\n## Diagnostic Questions (Step 1)\n使用已发布的诊断题卡；不凭诊断结果直接标记掌握。\n\n## Question Bank (Step 3b — Socratic)\n仅使用经发布门禁批准的 C01 题卡。\n\n## Hint Escalation Ladder (Step 3c)\n先独立尝试；H1、H2、H3 均不揭示完整答案；另设平行示范。\n\n## Misconceptions (Step 3d — Cognitive)\n可能把推测当成观察；仅在有证据时记录，避免给孩子贴标签。\n\n## Mastery Check (Step 3g)\n两种陌生场景各有三条事实与一条推测并有核实办法；使用本项目的跨机会和低提示门槛，不使用上游 80% 门槛。\n\n## Practice Tasks (Step 3h)\n审查过的不同场景练习。\n{\n  \"status\": \"current\",\n  \"version\": 2,\n  \"plan_sha256\": \"edc704a5ae618aae9a14fbafdf7f6d1b30cfaa73765acddb5930b29f32e3a1af\",\n  \"inputs\": {\n    \"curriculum_digest\": \"59e33c829943da8ccde45743c5994ff0f6de364349ead86e9df93773e6e9c334\",\n    \"learner_digest\": \"b756d37465e94cc6f17cbed759c4504ddd3dc3304237285fb75880a1c4febc39\",\n    \"evidence_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\"\n  },\n  \"review_queue\": [],\n  \"notice\": \"复习安排非掌握判定或教学授权；须重新检查实时门禁。\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
